WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.970
Open the PDF you want to share safely.

2
00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:09.936
Prices, emails, phone numbers and more are found for you, and marked in yellow.

3
00:00:10.336 --> 00:00:13.254
Tap a mark if you want to keep that text.

4
00:00:13.654 --> 00:00:16.156
When you're happy, click Remove and save.

5
00:00:16.556 --> 00:00:20.242
The marked text is deleted from the file, not just covered up.
